✅ 4. Combined Real Scenario (Very Important 🔥)

Scenario:
Website is down or very slow

Step-by-step approach:

Check disk:

df -h

→ If full → app may crash (no space for logs/temp)

Drill down:

du -sh /var/*

Check memory:

free -m
Correlate:
High memory → app issue
Disk full → log/backup issue
